ng","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T06:42:57-08:00","id":389792,"title":"","content":"What do humans know of the Stone Age?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:12:25-08:00","id":390247,"title":"","content":"I'm going to point out some huge shenanigans are going on with this poll. I was going around trying to get friends to vote for the Viking age..<br /> and during the course of a fifteen minute conversation nearly 100 votes in a poll that usually gets 4-5 votes per topic per hour goes straight to mage, increasing the gap substantially In the course of 15 minutes? Thats a significant amount of pollsters in a incredibly condensed period of time, how does that happen? Is there some secret cabal of mage players that synchronized their watches to vote all in the same exact fifteen minute span?<br /> <br /> I'm much more willing to beileve one mage player so desperatly wants a power fantasy setting where their one draw back is a thing of the past.. so they spoofed a bunch of IP adresses to vote.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4911,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","user":"Kireek","date":". 02-02-2015, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","name":"Kireek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:14:28-08:00","id":390252,"title":"","content":"Earlier the same thing happened towards the Werewolf side of things. Either it's legit or both sides have some cheaters. I think it's fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:17:49-08:00","id":390255,"title":"","content":"It's not fine then, I am definitely getting the impression that the WW side is cheating now too becuase its bumped up 60 or so votes in the past 20 minutes. Two sides cheating on this poll like mad is not okay. I'd rather this poll go to Geist then win what I want unfairly- its a classic setting idea with a decent group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","name":"Kireek","av