ember/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:23:17-08:00","id":390262,"title":"","content":"Oh, I don't mean cheating as in asking friends, I don't see a big issue there. I mean that it seem some people are using multiple IP addresses to give multiple votes. And I hope they can remove them, but I'm not sure if they'll be possible to identify.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:25:19-08:00","id":390284,"title":"","content":"It would be hilarious if they removed the extra votes from the same IP and Geist won.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:30:19-08:00","id":390291,"title":"","content":"Geist is clearly the one option that hasn't seen massive cheating. ^^ Much as I'd be sad to lose Werewolf, it'll serve the cheaters right if Onyx turn around and say they're letting Geist win.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2650-retias","name":"Retias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:38:59-08:00","id":390302,"title":"","content":"It does make any voting pointless when one person can just add however many votes they need to win.<br /> <br /> And punishing large victories by awarding the win to the one who didn't could be abused just as well, for instance if that was a rule, Geist fans might be upping the votes on Werewolf and Mage to get them disqualified. Not that that's happening, since that's not a rule.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:49:41-08:00","id":390309,"title":"","content":"It the time between my 2nd post and this one- Mage has another 300 votes.. Again, it might be legit, but in this hobby, such organization seems a bit much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","name":"Kireek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:49:44-08:00","id":390310,"title":"","content":"It's almost 3000 votes, and by the dynamic of them for the <b>Mage</b> - someone become a black wizard of net and used &quot;Summon Script&quot; Code spell. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Maybe purge of same IP votes should be done. But even, if <b>Werewolf</b> will lose, and there was mentioned that <b>Vampire</b> will return in next poll - I would see Vikings winning rather with 1800's Vamps. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T13:52:43-08:00","id":390311,"title":"","content":"The scope of these votes is insane- if iti s cheating- its definitely not equal, the mages are going balls to the walls hard with this cheating. There is no indication of them even trying to hide it via over long periods of time now, 300 votes over 40 minutes? Nonsense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","name":"Kireek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T14:17:31-08:00","id":390327,"title":"","content":"I've posted the concern in the WoD Dark Eras thread. I want mage to win, but not like that, this is kinda disgusting if it's true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T14:29:24-08:00","id":390363,"title":"","content":"So until you see some actual evidence, as opposed to baseless speculation, I feel like accusing anybody of cheating is kind of silly.<br /> <br /> You may be forgetting how large the potential pool of voters is:<br /> <br /> These forums, possibly including the OWoD guys<br /> RPG.net<br /> 4chan<br /> Reddit<br /> All sorts of Facebook, Twitter, Tumblr, and Google+ friend accounts<br /> <br /> I could easily believe there being 3000+ voters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T14:31:41-08:00","id":390380,"title":"","content":"Should friend accounts really matter? It seems like that way, people who have more friends can automatically get more votes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T14:39:09-08:00","id":390399,"title":"","content":"It is not a question of whether I believe the player base is that big. It is, this is a hobby with a lot of fans. The hobby itself is fragmented however! I do not believe it is so organized that there are 400-500 votes over the course of one hour- when the normal vote Talley about 2-5 per poll option every 10-15 minutes.<br /> <br /> As for the statement- don't say anything until there is evidence? What if no one said anything about it appearing suspicious? THere would be no accusation if people waited for evidence under that logic.Then no one would ever look. If there is something suspicious, people need to say something, because perhaps the votes are legit, and the mages are not cheating? No big deal! I cried wolf unjustly and I feel a bit ashamed of myself. I'm okay with that being the consequence. If there is cheating, its a HUGE deal, and if people get away with it, that is by far the bigger crime then me wanting to know that there appears to be very suspicious activity going on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4911,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","user":"Kireek","date":". 02-02-2015, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4911-kireek","name":"Kireek","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T15:34:16-08:00","id":390482,"title":"","content":"I agree. A sudden jump like that is incredibly off, especially when you consider people voting in those sort of numbers would have jumped on it early. I can't imagine a fan base that high waiting 2 days to do it. Not that they couldn't. Just that it's hinky","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T16:27:07-08:00","id":390576,"title":"","content":"All three options seem great to me. If there is cheating, it is sad. That would be fans of one game disrespecting their fellow fans of another game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/790-cire","name":"Cire","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T18:00:41-08:00","id":390726,"title":"","content":"Guys. Folks. People.<br /> <br /> Did y'all just completely forget that &quot;Change Vote&quot; is an option on this poll and that a bunch of Geist-voters have specifically said they'd probably change their vote near the end if it didn't look like the tide was going to turn?<br /> <br /> Let's not get needlessly accusatory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>"